# Extraction stub — arXiv:2208.10978

**Status:** stub. Full nougat OCR extraction was not required for this replication because Q²Chemistry is a **platform / software description paper** whose critical content (algorithm descriptions, Table 1 CNOT counts, Figs 5-7 caption text) is text-embedded in the PDF and was read directly from the arXiv HTML abstract + PDF view during triage.

